      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but i really cant go to a doctor, it's way too much hassle and expensive. i think it's just from the shock of the fall. if i took a high dose of some melatonin or maybe some extra vitamins it would help me just sleep it off tonight and feel better tomorrow morning right? i just want to make sure i can sleep through it so i dont have to worry about the light sensitivity anymore.",
